WEBVTT

00:23.310 --> 00:24.520
A kitty cat!

00:34.740 --> 00:36.070
So cute!

00:37.080 --> 00:42.750
You don't have a collar. So then...
Could you be a stray cat?

00:46.290 --> 00:47.750
Ow...

00:50.420 --> 00:51.840
No, you can't eat that!

00:54.090 --> 00:55.840
Are you hungry?

00:57.300 --> 00:59.390
Don't you have anywhere to live?

01:00.930 --> 01:04.600
If you want, you can
stay with me. How's that?

01:17.200 --> 01:19.080
U-um...

01:22.700 --> 01:25.000
So, that's the shape of it.

01:25.420 --> 01:30.550
So, I brought these kitties home with me,
and now I have five of them.

01:31.090 --> 01:33.549
Nico, you really don't
think things through.

01:33.550 --> 01:36.930
But I couldn't just leave them!

01:37.510 --> 01:42.350
If you get any more, this
place will turn into a cat shelter.

01:42.640 --> 01:43.640
But...

01:50.360 --> 01:51.859
Ippai hibiki MUSIC
Ring out, tons of music

01:51.860 --> 01:53.359
Ippai kimari POSING
Do tons of cool posing

01:53.360 --> 01:54.859
Ippai todoke FEELING
Let tons of feelings reach you

01:54.860 --> 01:56.359
Super Soni let's go!
Super Soni let's go!

01:56.360 --> 01:57.819
Suggoi shigeki tenkomori
Stimulation super piling up

01:57.820 --> 01:59.346
Suggoi tama ni karamawari
Sometimes super running in circles

01:59.370 --> 02:00.949
Suggoi kimi to zutto ENJOY
Always super enjoy being with you

02:00.950 --> 02:03.200
Super Soni LET'S GO! Desu
Super Soni let's go! Yes

02:15.170 --> 02:19.640
Saikin omoitsukimashita
Lately, I've come to realize

02:21.260 --> 02:25.600
Kimochi tsutaeru tte taihen
That getting feelings across is tough

02:27.350 --> 02:32.149
Umaku dekitari dekinattari
Whether it goes well or not

02:32.150 --> 02:35.899
Muzukashii kara oku no te de
Is tough, so my trump card

02:35.900 --> 02:38.490
Mouretsu taiatari desu
Is going for it at full force

02:40.240 --> 02:42.530
Dakedo hitomishiri (hitomishiri)
But I'm shy (shy)

02:43.160 --> 02:45.960
Gomakashite senobi (senobi)
I act like it's nothing and aim high (high)

02:46.330 --> 02:47.869
Ashi ga gakuburu de
With legs trembling

02:47.870 --> 02:51.130
Hirakinaotte arinomama GO!
I get serious and just go for it!

02:51.500 --> 02:54.129
Zenkai, soukai, daitenkai Recuperation,
exhilaration, a big revolution

02:54.130 --> 02:57.170
Nandemo chokushin STRAIGHT
No matter what, keep heading straight

02:57.510 --> 03:00.179
Sekai, mankai, mugendai
The world, in full bloom, infinity

03:00.180 --> 03:03.719
Kyou mo genki ni koko ni imasu (HEY!) I'm
here again today, living to the fullest (Hey!)

03:03.720 --> 03:05.246
Ippai hibike MUSIC
Ring out, tons of music

03:05.270 --> 03:06.679
Ippai kimari POSING
Do tons of cool posing

03:06.680 --> 03:08.326
Ippai todoke FEELING?
Let tons of feelings reach you

03:08.350 --> 03:09.599
Super Soni let's go!
Super Soni let's go!

03:09.600 --> 03:11.269
Suggoi shigeki tenkomori
Stimulation super piling up

03:11.270 --> 03:12.609
Suggoi tama ni karamawari
Sometimes super running in circles

03:12.610 --> 03:14.416
Suggoi kimi to zutto ENJOY
Always super enjoy being with you

03:14.440 --> 03:16.610
SUPER SONI LET'S GO! Desu
Super Soni let's go! Yes

03:18.860 --> 03:21.950
The wait is over, ladies and gentlemen.

03:22.530 --> 03:27.620
Introducing the new machine competing
in next year's Super Car Challenge!

03:33.250 --> 03:39.050
The frame matches this year's model, but each element
has been updated to greatly improve performance!

03:39.590 --> 03:41.590
It completely captures this year's theme...

03:42.930 --> 03:44.930
"Recapturing the throne"!

03:56.520 --> 03:58.240
Good work today, Sonico.

03:59.070 --> 04:02.280
So, I'll see you at the office at
2:00 the day after tomorrow.

04:02.570 --> 04:03.570
Sir!

04:07.160 --> 04:08.870
Thank you very much.

04:14.210 --> 04:19.550
I go to school tomorrow, then help with
the cooking at Grandma's pub at night.

04:27.060 --> 04:28.930
Hello, little kitty cat!

04:32.310 --> 04:34.060
Look at those stubby legs!

04:36.440 --> 04:37.980
You're so cute!

04:38.230 --> 04:40.690
Nico, you really don't
think things through.

04:41.700 --> 04:46.660
If you get any more, this place will
to turn into a cat shelter.

04:47.910 --> 04:49.809
B-but...

04:49.810 --> 04:54.810
RAMEN AND A SMALL RICE

04:50.660 --> 04:52.540
But, but...!

05:24.280 --> 05:26.030
I'm home, everyone.

05:29.640 --> 05:29.760
Fami-TWO Pet Clinic

05:32.040 --> 05:36.830
We have a new member
of the family today. Ta-daa!

05:38.710 --> 05:41.250
Okay, please give him a proper greeting.

05:46.510 --> 05:48.470
First, we need to get you cleaned up.

05:48.930 --> 05:51.060
This way, please.

05:55.810 --> 05:58.190
Please stay still, okay?

05:58.610 --> 06:01.150
Hold out just a little longer.

06:09.280 --> 06:11.790
Don't jump around like that!

06:21.210 --> 06:23.670
There. All clean!

06:24.420 --> 06:28.180
Okay, Kitty, let me introduce
you to your new family.

06:28.970 --> 06:32.060
Char! Siu! Men!

06:32.600 --> 06:35.100
Naruto. And Ajitama!

06:41.110 --> 06:46.690
Oh, that's right. I need to give
you a name, Kitty. Let's see...

06:49.200 --> 06:54.370
We've got Char, Siu, Men,
Naruto, and Ajitama, so...

06:55.160 --> 06:59.670
Rice! Yup! You're white
and small, so it's perfect!

07:01.000 --> 07:04.380
Your name is Rice now.

07:07.130 --> 07:08.130
Rice!

07:10.050 --> 07:13.430
Do you like it? I'm glad.

07:16.180 --> 07:20.600
Oh, that's right. You're
hungry, aren't you?

07:21.650 --> 07:25.530
Just wait here. I'll get your food ready.

07:34.990 --> 07:38.000
Rice, you're still so
small, so you get milk.

07:38.960 --> 07:39.960
There.

07:42.250 --> 07:44.750
You sure were hungry, huh?

07:50.590 --> 07:54.349
Char, stop that! That's Rice's milk.

07:54.350 --> 07:56.390
Your food is over there.

08:03.020 --> 08:06.150
Just use that as your bed for now.

08:11.070 --> 08:15.660
I was so nervous today, being in
front of all those people...

08:16.490 --> 08:19.370
G'night, everyone.

10:51.730 --> 10:53.400
Thanks for waking me up.

10:53.730 --> 10:55.280
Well, see you later.

11:07.160 --> 11:11.380
The blue whale is the
largest animal on Earth.

11:11.580 --> 11:18.260
Hunting them was banned in 1954, and while there are
still few of them left, their numbers are improving.

12:18.150 --> 12:19.570
I'm home!

12:23.610 --> 12:26.910
You mustn't. It's dangerous outside.

12:30.960 --> 12:32.580
Yes, I know.

12:34.580 --> 12:36.840
I'll get your food ready right now.

12:52.710 --> 12:54.190
PUB

12:52.710 --> 12:54.530
ZEPPELIN

12:54.191 --> 12:55.670
TODAY'S SPECIALS

12:54.531 --> 12:55.690
Oh, dear, Sonico.

12:56.150 --> 12:58.440
You brought ANOTHER cat home?

12:58.650 --> 13:03.030
Well, he's still just a
baby. And he was hungry.

13:03.700 --> 13:07.490
If you don't stop, your place
will turn into a cat shelter.

13:09.240 --> 13:12.160
That's what Fuuri said...

13:12.500 --> 13:15.669
By the way, what breed is your new kitten?

13:15.670 --> 13:21.130
Um, I think he's probably a Munchkin...

13:21.840 --> 13:26.800
Munchkins are VERY expensive!
Wouldn't he have an owner?

13:27.050 --> 13:29.260
But he didn't have a collar.

13:29.640 --> 13:36.230
The neighborhood association meets tomorrow.
We should ask if anyone's looking for a kitten.

13:36.350 --> 13:37.650
Um, yeah.

13:39.440 --> 13:40.690
It's raining now!

13:40.820 --> 13:42.109
Oh, my, it is?

13:42.110 --> 13:43.950
Man, what a pain.

14:36.870 --> 14:42.170
I'm home. It's raining
out there. Sorry I'm late.

14:49.010 --> 14:51.100
What's wrong, Men?

15:05.090 --> 15:06.945
GREEN
TEA

15:05.090 --> 15:07.359
POTATO CHIPS

15:07.360 --> 15:09.109
Ouka and Sonico!

15:09.110 --> 15:17.110
Once news of this photo shoot comes out, boys across
the world are sure to fall under the spell of my charm!

15:18.750 --> 15:20.630
Isn't that right, Sonico?

15:21.500 --> 15:24.380
Yes. I'm sure you're right, Ouka.

15:26.710 --> 15:32.600
At long last, the Age of Ouka will begin!
But I mustn't let my guard down.

15:32.720 --> 15:36.929
Well, good night. I have to get going now. I have to come up with a super
cool catchphrase, one that will win the Word of the Year. Right, Sonico?

15:36.930 --> 15:41.010
I have to come up with a super cool catchphrase, one
that will win the Word of the Year. Right, Sonico?

15:41.440 --> 15:42.440
Huh?

15:51.740 --> 15:55.029
I splurged and bought some new cat food.

15:55.030 --> 15:57.540
I hope they all like it.

16:00.500 --> 16:01.620
I'm ho...

16:03.920 --> 16:04.920
Rice!

16:06.420 --> 16:08.550
Come back, Rice!

16:12.470 --> 16:15.389
Rice? Where are you?

16:15.390 --> 16:16.560
Sonico.

16:16.850 --> 16:17.850
Grandma?

16:18.220 --> 16:26.149
I asked at the association meeting, and the Shinozakis
over on 4th are looking for a lost Munchkin kitten.

16:26.150 --> 16:28.280
But Rice has run away!

16:28.570 --> 16:30.860
"Rice"? You mean, the kitten?

16:31.110 --> 16:32.780
I'll go look for him.

16:33.160 --> 16:38.829
And I'll ask the Shinozakis to see if he's
gone home to them. I'll call you later.

16:38.830 --> 16:39.830
Thank you!

17:16.780 --> 17:22.329
Sonico, I called the Shinozakis, but
they said the kitten hasn't come back yet.

17:22.330 --> 17:25.370
Okay. I'll keep looking.

17:25.670 --> 17:28.459
I'll call you again if he comes back.

17:28.460 --> 17:29.500
Thank you.

17:33.840 --> 17:34.840
Rice!

17:36.050 --> 17:37.050
Rice...

17:39.310 --> 17:46.650
You must have been trying to get back to
your owner. I'm sorry for not realizing that.

17:47.400 --> 17:50.780
Please, Rice. Be safe.

18:07.880 --> 18:09.170
A white kitten?

18:09.380 --> 18:13.069
Yes. A small breed called a Munchkin.

18:13.070 --> 18:14.995
Ayaka

18:14.996 --> 18:16.840
I saw a white kitty run over that way!

18:17.130 --> 18:18.590
Thank you, Ayaka!

19:04.680 --> 19:05.810
Rice!

19:07.430 --> 19:10.060
Rice, where are you?

19:12.650 --> 19:16.440
Char! Siu! Men! Naruto! Ajitama!

19:16.900 --> 19:18.400
What are you doing here?

19:19.240 --> 19:21.700
And you're covered in mud.

19:23.660 --> 19:27.580
Rice! Oh, thank goodness!

19:28.410 --> 19:33.290
Jeez. You had me worried!
You're not hurt, are you?

19:35.420 --> 19:38.970
I'm glad... I'm just so glad!

19:41.970 --> 19:44.049
Oh, Cream!

19:44.050 --> 19:45.640
I've been so worried!

19:47.640 --> 19:50.730
Thank you very much for finding him.

19:51.190 --> 19:53.649
Ah, no! It was no trouble!

19:53.650 --> 19:58.400
Rice... I mean, CREAM made
it home safely, so I'm glad.

20:03.200 --> 20:06.120
Oh, my. You came to say hello, Mama?

20:06.910 --> 20:08.750
You've been worried, haven't you?

20:10.370 --> 20:13.210
I see. He has a mother.

20:14.130 --> 20:16.800
I'm sure he must've missed her.

20:20.260 --> 20:23.140
Well, I'll be going now.

20:23.430 --> 20:27.890
Again, thank you so
much. And thank YOU, cats.

20:33.650 --> 20:40.530
Well, I'm glad Rice got back to his owner
and his mom. Come on, let's go home.

20:49.040 --> 20:56.250
You all... You'll miss him, huh?
You all finally got to be friends.

21:29.490 --> 21:31.249
Kareha mau kisetsu
The season in which dry leaves flutter

21:31.250 --> 21:33.730
Akane sora haeru michi de
On roads reflecting the reddening sky

21:33.910 --> 21:35.419
Unmei no hajimari
The beginnings of our destiny

21:35.420 --> 21:37.980
Maiorita tenshi no you na
Like an angel floating down from heaven

21:38.210 --> 21:42.670
Kimi o dakishimete, ie ni kaerou
I hold you close, let's go home

21:44.970 --> 21:49.180
Soshite egaite yukou
And begin envisioning them

21:49.680 --> 21:53.390
Kagayakeru hibi
Our glorious days together

21:53.770 --> 21:57.600
Nobiru bokura no kage
Chasing after our outstretched

21:58.270 --> 22:01.150
Oikakete Shadows

22:02.230 --> 22:06.240
Kakegae no nai toki
Those irreplaceable moments

22:06.570 --> 22:10.910
Hitotsuzutsu wakariaeru
I can make out every single one

22:11.200 --> 22:17.170
Afureru nukumori kanjite
I feel that overflowing warmth

22:19.460 --> 22:23.300
Kimi no kodou, shigusa ga
Your heartbeat, what you do

22:23.590 --> 22:28.010
Yasashii toki o kizamu
Carve out gentle moments in time

22:28.220 --> 22:30.680
Mitsumetai
I want to stare at you

22:31.010 --> 22:34.730
Daisuki na kimi o
The one I love so much

22:51.490 --> 22:53.160
Rice!

22:54.660 --> 22:56.160
What are you doing here?

22:56.660 --> 22:58.790
Did you run away again?

23:04.670 --> 23:10.510
Or maybe... I get it. I'll
contact Mrs. Shinozaki.

23:12.100 --> 23:14.350
Hey, guys! Rice came to...

23:19.560 --> 23:22.480
Hey, you're all heavy!

23:24.960 --> 23:32.960
Next Episode Preview

23:25.530 --> 23:27.740
The local shopping arcade is in trouble!

23:27.860 --> 23:31.740
Nico, Fuuri! To save our
shops, you must wear this!

23:32.120 --> 23:34.120
THIS costume?

23:34.430 --> 23:36.450
It looks extremely chilly...

23:36.770 --> 23:39.980
A Saint Comes to Town

23:37.160 --> 23:39.670
Next time, "A Saint Comes to Town."
